Z||000010||Archie||11-29-2001||02:33 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pherder:<BR><B>Well, I must be another that is "off" on the Technet list.<P>I can sign into Topica and it tells me I'm a member of the list but I don't get the email messages even though I am setup to get emails.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Paul (pherder AT kscable DOT com)<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Paul, I've turned you on again  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BTW, Paul, I can't find your address to send those parts to....could you EMail it to me?<P>Archie||||reg||1
